comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T16:45:24.383Z",codex-root,Only the child implementation task will be claimed and marked in progress; this plan remains open in executing mode until delivery evidence is complete.
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T16:45:24.383Z",codex-root,Use blocking waits for long-running gates and review agents; take one fresh exact-head inventory only after all checks settle.
