plan_mode: executing
plan_scope: Official Core trace/list trace/get and trace/contexts contracts; typed bounded CLI UX; capability/schema/docs integration; exact local and privacy-safe live proof; hosted review and merge.
plan_harness: codex
plan_resume_context: Continue on agent/typed-automation-trace-diagnostics. Official 2026.8.0 and local 2026.7.4 support trace list get contexts. PM feature hac-of5a is open. Create and claim one child task then implement typed bounded read-only commands with schemas docs and exhaustive proof.
plan_validation[2]{text,command,expected}:
  "Implementation quality gates passed: release:verify covered typecheck, ESLint, 133/133 docstrings, jscpd, source size, ShellCheck, PM validation and health, build, 1,380 tests, exact 100/100/100/100 coverage, Trivy, secret and history audit. Live read-only E2E passed against Core 2026.7.4 across all six formats and isolated wizard/config. pm-changelog 2026.8.7 reported unchanged canonical output; version policy and npx plus bunx packed-tarball dry-run passed. Ad hoc markdownlint-cli2 reports 547 pre-existing repository-wide findings and is not a configured release gate; wholesale legacy docs reformat is intentionally outside this trace feature.","bun run release:verify && bun run test:e2e:live && bun run changelog:pm:check && bun run version:check && bun run release:dry-run",All canonical mandatory gates and live/package acceptance tests pass without persisting private payloads.
  "Automatic daily release dry-run passed from clean commit 5f6104b. It detected five release-relevant commits since v2026.8.6, selected target v2026.8.7, reran the full release gate and npx plus bunx package smoke, and did not push or publish.","bun run release:auto:dry-run","Dry-run selects the next immutable daily version, fully verifies it, and leaves pushed=false."
plan_decisions[1]{ts,author,decision,rationale,evidence}:
  "2026-08-07T16:46:20.420Z",codex-root,Implement read-only trace discovery and retrieval now; exclude breakpoint and live debug controls.,Trace list get and contexts are stable administrator diagnostics and safe under read-only operation. Breakpoint controls can pause alter or stop active executions and require a separate safety boundary and explicit mutation design.,Home Assistant Core 2026.8.0 homeassistant/components/trace/websocket_api.py plus live 2026.7.4 contract probes.
plan_discoveries[1]{ts,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T16:46:21.190Z",codex-root,trace/list returns summary rows for automation or script and optional item_id; trace/get requires domain item_id run_id and returns the full trace; trace/contexts accepts either no filter or an inclusive domain plus item_id pair.
