body: The implementation uses official Home Assistant Core 2026.8.0 source as the normative command schema and verifies backward compatibility against the local 2026.7.4 instance. Breakpoint and live debugger mutation are excluded. The exact trace get command intentionally preserves the Core object while discovery defaults remain bounded and deterministic.
